===Noun===
'''rubella''' 

# {{pathology}} A mild disease caused by the Rubella virus infecting the [[respiratory tract]], and characterised by a rash of pink dots, fever and swollen [[lymph node]]s.

====Synonyms====
* [[epidemic roseola]]
* [[German measles]]
* [[three-day measles]]

